OL,3,GNEWSASome media outlets evacuated after
OL,4,Abomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of high-profile media
OL,7,Forganisations, including Ireland's
OL,8,Fpublic service broadcaster RTE have
OL,9,Fbeen evacuated after threats were made
OL,10,Fagainst them.
OL,12,FAn RTE radio presenter told listeners
OL,13,Fthat the organisation had received an
OL,14,Femail warning that a "bomb was going to
OL,15,Fgo off within 45 minutes".
OL,17,FStaff at the Irish Independent
OL,18,Fnewspaper and the Dublin offices of
OL,19,Fradio stations NewstalkFM and TodayFM,
OL,20,Fwere also advised to leave their
OL,21,Fbuildings and UK broadcaster Sky said
OL,22,Fit also received a security threat.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
